{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/items/409/", "pk": 409, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bodyglove/", "pk": 335, "shortname": "bodyglove", "name": "Body Glove Hawaii", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Deluxe Snorkel & Dolphin Watch", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 7, "unicode": "Deluxe Snorkel & Dolphin Watch", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": false, "sortable_index": 0, "description": "## Duration \n4.5 Hours\n\n#Available Times\nOffered Everyday at 8 AM\n\n#About\nDiscover Kona’s underwater paradise! Accessible only by boat, join us in the crystal clear water of the protected marine sanctuaries of Red Hill which are home to more than 600 species of enchanting ocean wildlife. Excellent chance of dolphin or other marine mammal sightings.  Breakfast & BBQ Lunch are included.  First-timers or experts of all ages can snorkel with us and we provide all the equipment you’ll need including Reef Safe sunscreen. Beginners will be confident snorkelers quickly after the fun introduction lesson from our lifeguard-trained crew. Enjoy the inspiring world of Hawaii’s underwater paradise!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Departure from The Kailua Pier, snorkel sites along the Kona Coast", "booking_notes": "#Mahalo for booking with Body Glove Cruises\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you for your Deluxe Morning Snorkel & Dolphin Watch!\n\nFree parking is available at our retail shop in Ilima Court Shopping Center. The address is 75-5629 Kuakini Highway, Kailua Kona, HI 96740. It's about a 5-7 minute walk down to the pier. Boarding begins 30 minutes prior to departure.\n\n##Discover unique, locally made treasures in our gift shop [The Boatique](https://www.instagram.com/theboatiquehi/)—show this email for 10% off your purchase!\n\n![Description of image](https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/cGKvVAYQeO8QiavAeq1K)\n***\n\n#Boat Information:\n\n- This tour takes place on the [KANOA II](https://www.bodyglovehawaii.com/our-boat), our 65 ft. Luxury Catamaran.\n- Please note that our vessel is a **SMOKE FREE** vessel.\n- Take a moment to familiarize yourself with our [safety briefing](https://www.bodyglovehawaii.com/safety).\n\n\n#Included On This Trip:\n\n- Breakfast, lunch, sodas, juices and snacks\n- Snorkel gear, instruction and flotation toys\n- Alcoholic beverages are available for purchase from our Premium Bar \nProudly serving locally made rum, vodka, whiskey, and beer\n- Plenty of shade, fresh water showers, and restrooms\n- 20 foot water slide & 15 foot high dive platform\n- Double wide swim steps\n- Excellent chance of dolphin or other marine mammal sightings\n\nJust bring a towel and a smile!\n\n#Special Dietary Requests:\nFor gluten-free, vegetarian, or vegan meals, please call 800.551.8911 at least **48 hours** before your adventure.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 30, "headline": "Most Popular! • All Ages • 4.5 Hours", "short_description": "", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/D9WDnEUCQ12DtOwCtEmQ", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/D9WDnEUCQ12DtOwCtEmQ", "images": [